70%</span><span style=\"text-indent: -42.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">이상 백신접종에 따른 대학생의 학습 및 사회</span><span style=\"text-indent: -42.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">•</span><span style=\"text-indent: -42.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 14pt;\">정서적 결손 예방을 위하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -42.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"text-indent: -42.8pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">교육부에서 대학의 대면활동 확대 협조 요청</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">□ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">우리대학 대면수업 확대 방안</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">거리두기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">단계 수업방법 변경</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">당초</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">거리두기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">단계 전환 시 전면 원격수업 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">→ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(52, 45, 190); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(52, 45, 190); font-size: 14pt;\">변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(52, 45, 190); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(52, 45, 190); font-size: 14pt;\">대면</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(52, 45, 190); font-size: 14pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(52, 45, 190); font-size: 14pt;\">원격병행</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(52, 45, 190); font-size: 14pt;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(52, 45, 190); font-size: 14pt;\">원격수업 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">거리두기 </span><